{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_12244100","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12244100","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1224409001:":{"text":"Tesio colluded with the Wights and caused the deaths of several villagers.","source_cn":"……泰西欧勾结水鬼，出卖血薇帮，还害死小水村的尤里、霍斯……等人","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5CA8B4E429C8A1E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1224409002:":{"text":"In light of the overwhelming evidence, Tesio's guilt is proven.","source_cn":"——综上所述，证据确凿，泰西欧罪无可恕","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF0CA3A624DA50377","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1224409003:":{"text":"Under Rustport's Public Safety Code, Tesio's sentenced to death!","source_cn":"按照锈锚港治安条例，泰西欧判处死刑！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD734D1BF0B13F7C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:5:1224410001:0":{"text":"After Tesio is escorted away...","source_cn":"泰西欧被押走后……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4E97C00B2D44C4A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1224410002:0":{"text":"Tesio, you deserve this! Bah!","source_cn":"泰西欧！早就该死了！呸！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFB7B22B6C4B93624","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1224410003:0":{"text":"Feed him to the sharks!","source_cn":"把他扔去喂鲨鱼！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4EF5BA8BC48DB96B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1224410004:0":{"text":"Finally... Finally!\nThis day has come at last!","source_cn":"总算……总算！\\n我们总算等到这一天了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3732F1C8F58CD3B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1224410005:1":{"text":"Such a tragic end for a mafia boss...","source_cn":"唉，一代黑帮教父，没想到落得这个下场……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F02258FAFCF6ED2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1224410006:0":{"text":"Feel sorry for him? You can join him if you want.","source_cn":"可怜他？你想去陪他吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79E2C2F78BC082BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1224410007:0":{"text":"No, I just said it off the top of my head. He certainly deserves this.","source_cn":"不不不，我只是随口说一说。这都是他应得的，应得的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE9022B7CA64E18CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1224410008:0":{"text":"Hmph, be careful with your words!\nWhat goes around comes around!","source_cn":"哼，祸从口出！\\n同样，做的坏事多了，会有恶报！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x20484B24DAFB4CFF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1224410009:0":{"text":"Indeed... Indeed...","source_cn":"说的是……说的是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26F6C73179155FA7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1224410010:1":{"text":"Next up, we'll focus on reviving the trading activities in Rustport.","source_cn":"接下来，血薇帮会帮锈锚港恢复贸易。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB38944E1F5BDDA88","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1224410011:1":{"text":"We'll repair and expand the docks first. Once they're ready, we'll issue a trade subsidy to every departing ship. On top of that...","source_cn":"我们会先修建扩大码头，等码头开放后，每艘出航的船只将获...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3DF4F4298E35EE2A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1224410012:1":{"text":"...We'll also lower the trade taxes!","source_cn":"——我们还将降低贸易税！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x94F3F7D0BEEA8290","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1224410013:0":{"text":"Sonja's great!","source_cn":"索尼娅英明！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x542740F3EAAB2D9C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1224410014:1":{"text":"Glory to the Carmine Whispers!","source_cn":"血薇帮万岁！！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86C4A2159C1AE67F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1224410015:1":{"text":"We can set sail to do business again!","source_cn":"终于又能出海贸易了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6EA57907B68E12C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1224410016:1":{"text":"It's nice to have the subsidy!","source_cn":"居然还有出海补贴，太棒了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4D72927ABF4CE4EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1224410017:0":{"text":"Wow, sounds like the Carmine Whispers have to shell out a fortune for this policy!","source_cn":"哇哦，听起来血薇帮要多花好多钱啊……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F014791FDF80F4B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1224410018:1":{"text":"It's all for the greater good!","source_cn":"这是因为，只要锈锚港好起来，血薇帮也会好起来的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7A3A1F364D333F07","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:43:12051416:0":{"text":"As the villagers of Brineville celebrate the outcome of Tesio's trial, Sinbad quietly slips away from the crowd.","source_cn":"小水村的人见证了泰西欧的审判，所有人都在为此欢呼时，人...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x42E8D68F52844A23","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:索尼娅":{"text":"Sonja","source":"索尼娅","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:村民塔莎":{"text":"Tasha","source":"村民塔莎","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:村民罗西":{"text":"Rosy","source":"村民罗西","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:村长碧希":{"text":"Blanca","source":"村长碧希","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:锈锚港居民罗南":{"text":"Citizen Rona","source":"锈锚港居民罗南","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:锈锚港居民克斯":{"text":"Citizen Kex","source":"锈锚港居民克斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:情报贩子灰舌":{"text":"Dealer Grayfang","source":"情报贩子灰舌","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"Chippy","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"Hammie","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑屏字幕":{"text":"Subtitles","source":"黑屏字幕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":27,"localized_text_count":22,"speaker_count":10}}